# Where U-Boot keeps its environment, for fw_printenv / fw_setenv - and so for
# RAUC and porchlight-data. Two copies in raw sectors before the first
# partition (board/porchlight/rpi4/uboot.fragment says why); two lines here
# is what tells fw_setenv the environment is redundant. Offsets and size must
# match U-Boot's CONFIG_ENV_OFFSET, _REDUND and _SIZE exactly, or each side
# reads the other's environment as corrupt.
#
# device        offset     size
/dev/mmcblk0    0x100000   0x4000
/dev/mmcblk0    0x200000   0x4000
